---
// Home-page entry point to the meal helper (/helper).
---

<div class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-7xl px-4" dir="rtl">
    <a
        href="/helper"
        class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-white px-5 py-4 ring-1 ring-black/5 transition hover:ring-[var(--main-color)] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[var(--main-color)]"
    >
        <span class="flex flex-col gap-0.5">
            <span class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-lg">مش عارف تطلب إيه؟</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-600">جاوب على كام سؤال ونرشحلك الأنسب ليك</span>
        </span>
        <span class="shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-[var(--main-color)] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">ساعدني أختار</span>
    </a>
</div>
